@startuml ver2_product_search_sequence
title juchu01 ver.2 商品検索・詳細表示シーケンス

actor 顧客 as Customer
boundary "商品一覧JSP" as ListView
boundary "カテゴリ別商品詳細JSP\ncosd1040～cosd1044" as DetailView
control JuchuControl
control ShohinControl
control DaoControl
control DaoShohin
control "カテゴリ別DAO\nDaoFoods / DaoAv / DaoPc" as CategoryDao
database "H2 COSCOMMON02\n(juchu02)" as DB

Customer -> ListView : カテゴリ選択・検索
ListView -> JuchuControl : category=0301等
JuchuControl -> ShohinControl : getShohinList(category,営業所)
ShohinControl -> DaoControl : selectShohin(category,営業所)
DaoControl -> DaoShohin : サブカテゴリ検索
DaoShohin -> DB : 共通項目・在庫を検索
DB --> DaoShohin : 商品一覧
DaoShohin --> DaoControl
DaoControl --> ShohinControl
ShohinControl --> JuchuControl
JuchuControl --> ListView : 共通項目・在庫表示

Customer -> ListView : 詳細ボタン
ListView -> JuchuControl : 商品コード
JuchuControl -> ShohinControl : getShohinList(商品コード,営業所)
ShohinControl -> DaoControl : 商品コード先頭2桁で振り分け
DaoControl -> CategoryDao : 03/04/05の詳細検索
CategoryDao -> DB : 共通項目・固有項目・在庫を検索
DB --> CategoryDao : 商品詳細
CategoryDao --> DaoControl
DaoControl --> ShohinControl
ShohinControl --> JuchuControl
JuchuControl -> DetailView : 商品コード先頭2桁で画面選択
DetailView --> Customer : 共通項目・固有項目・画像表示

note over DaoControl, CategoryDao
  03=Foods、04=Av、05=Pc
end note

@enduml
